me like that!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_whitenoise","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Crackle— "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"They hear the familiar sound once again. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"They close their eyes with no struggle left in them, silently awaiting for their fate to pass..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"openEyes","raw":"睁眼"},{"type":"background","value":"99","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"CMR30","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_whitenoise","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"CMR-30","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Huh? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"W-where are we?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Cloak_Whoosh","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_NightOPS","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"CMR-30 clambers to her feet at the first sign of light. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The rest of the group open their eyes—"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A viscous grey slowly flows and extends, meeting with blackened earth at the horizon. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Dust and smog assault the senses."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"80typeMod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Type 80","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This is... a new stage?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M1928A1","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Thompson","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yeah... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This should be.. the final stage..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"CMR30","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"CMR-30","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Captain Thompson!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"As if awaking from an overlong dream, Thompson smiles as she sits up with some difficulty."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"80typeMod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Type 80","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Don't push yourself, Thompson! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You might've recovered a little, but that body's anything but stable. You can't be going into battle."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M1928A1","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Thompson","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Of course I know that. I'm planning to go the strategist route for you lot."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"CMR30","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"CMR-30","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Why do you say this is the final stage, Captain?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M1928A1","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Thompson","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Because this is the most vicious battle in Griffin's history. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I struggle to think of a more fitting final question... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Wouldn't you say, Ceno?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"CMR-30 turns around to find Ceno frozen a little distance from them, as she gazes beyond the barrier. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Suppressed as it may be, a deep, rich anger bleeds through her eyes—an expression CMR-30 has never seen before."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"CMR30","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"CMR-30","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Miss... Ceno?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"80typeMod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Type 80","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No, give her a moment. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Back then, she and her sister requested to be sent to the frontlines... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"They survived Sangvis, they survived the military's electronic interference, but death caught up in the end."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"CMR-30 is hit with a realization."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"CMR30","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"CMR-30","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I see now... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This is zone S11, a joint drill between Griffin and the military! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I never knew Miss Ceno saw a battlefield like this and suffered a complete defeat..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Carcano1938","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Carcano M91/38","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Complete defeat? Says who?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ceno's voice comes from behind CMR-30 without any notice, making her shiver."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Carcano1938","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Carcano M91/38","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Excuse me, T-Dolls have never lost on the battlefield."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"CMR30","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"CMR-30","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But, Miss Ceno..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Carcano1938","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Carcano M91/38","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You win, or you die."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Thompson and Type 80 share a look, smiling with understanding."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M1928A1","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Thompson","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Well said, Ceno. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Cough, cough..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M1928A1","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"80typeMod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Type 80","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You better sit back!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M1928A1","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Thompson","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Haha... got it. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But, I think instead of dying, I would rather hope that we win."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Thompson silently extends a hand, looking around her circle of companions. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Type 80 bends down somewhat, putting her hand atop Thompson's. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Then comes CMR-30's. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Finally, Ceno's."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"80typeMod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Type 80","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We won't just hope—"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"众人","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"WE WILL WIN!","style":{"size":"50"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePoint","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
